REACTION   (75-RE-185(G,N)75-RE-184,,SIG,,,EVAL)
ANALYSIS   The reliable contribution  of partial  reaction
            (g,1n) cross-section into the neutron yield
            cross-section SIG(g,xn) was evaluated using
            theoretically calculated ratio
                F1-theor = SIG-theor(g,1n)/SIG-theor(g,xn)
            by the way
                SIG-eval(g,1n) = (F1-theor)x(SIG-exp(g,xn)).
REL-REF    (E,,B.S.Ishkhanov+,J,YF,71,517,2008)
           Preequilibrium model of photonuclear reactions based
            on the Fermi gas densities used for calculation
            F1-theor.
           (R,M0645004,A.M.Goryachev+,J,SNP,17,236,1973)
            Published cross sections.
STATUS     (DEP,M0645004)
            Published neutron yield cross-section SIG(g,xn).
           (TABLE,,V.V.Varlamov+,J,PAN,89,251,2026)
            Data plotted in Fig. 4a left (circles).
ENDBIB              18
